"Pixhawk is typically powered via its \"power\" port, as shown in the picture"
" below. The power port simultaneously powers Pixhawk and reads voltage and "
"current analog measurements produced by an optional power module. "
"Information about powering the Pixhawk can be found in the topic "
":ref:`Powering the Pixhawk <common-powering-the-pixhawk>`."
