#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:112
#: 703d691ca0f749aa8c62bac1926cc7c1
msgid ""
"The skid-steer parameters are used to configure vehicles that have fixed "
"wheels and steer like tank tracks (do not use servos to steer the wheels but"
" rather use differential speed between the left and right wheels). The "
"parameters are: SKID_STEER_OUT and SKID_STEER_IN. When enabled, autopilot's "
"output RC1 is used for the left track control, and output RC3 is used for "
"right track control."
msgstr ""
"差速转向参数用于配置固定车轮、以坦克履带方式转向的车辆（不使用舵机转向车轮，而是通过左右轮差速实现转向）。相关参数为：SKID_STEER_OUT 和 "
"SKID_STEER_IN。启用后，飞控的 RC1 输出用于左履带控制，RC3 输出用于右履带控制。"
